<title>USA: Dow opens slightly lower, Nasdaq opens up.</title>
<headline>Dow opens slightly lower, Nasdaq opens up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street  opened mixed on Thursday, with stocks continuing to watch bonds for direction and signs of interest rate concerns.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials were off 2.58 at 7354.68 and the Nasdaq Composite was up 1.80 at 1411.98.</p>
</text>
